{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ZBXiPOaqrX3_UQ9_nsHqQA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:24.040310+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ZBXiPOaqrX3_UQ9_nsHqQA","html":"<div><section><section><section></section><section><section><section><p><span>北京大学社会研究中心将通过2026年度北京大学光华管理学院“全国优秀大学生夏令营”活动面向全国优秀大学生招收社会学专业推荐免试制博士研究生。</span></p><p><span>中心社会学博士项目旨在培养社会分层、人口社会学、家庭社会学、社会统计学和社会网络等相关专业领域的高级专业人才。本项目强调</span><strong><span>定量方法的训练</span></strong><span>，注重培养学生用数据去认识理解当代中国社会的能力。我们要求学生博士毕业时能</span><strong><span>全面系统地掌握社会学基础理论和社会科学量化分析方法</span></strong><span>、能</span><strong><span>深入了解自己所研究领域的理论框架和研究前沿</span></strong><span>、能</span><strong><span>独立地从事相关科研教学工作并达到国内/国外顶尖水平。</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>活动安排</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1. 专业宣讲：邀请中心师生参与活动，向营员介绍中心的师资队伍、培养目标、培养方案。</span></p><p><span>2. 主题讲座：邀请中心教授及相关学者向营员分享学术研究。</span></p><p><span>3. 水平测试：笔试及面试（定量研究方法及社会科学相关知识）。</span></p><p><span>4. 时间：7月中旬（</span><strong><span>报名时间为6月1日00:00—6月16日中午12:00</span></strong><span>）。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>活动具体安排、水平测试要求将在获得入营资格后另行通知。</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>申请资格</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1. 全国高校 2027 届应届本科毕业生。</span></p><p><span>2. 学习成绩优秀，专业背景不限。</span></p><p><span>3. 对学术研究有浓厚的兴趣，有从事学术研究工作的强烈意愿。</span></p><p><span>4. 英语水平良好。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>申请方式</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>申请人需在“光华管理学院夏令营网上报名系统”注册并填写信息。</span></p><p><span>网址：</span><span><span>apply.gsm.pku.edu.cn/#/camp/status</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>在线申请材料包括：</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>1.《2026年北京大学光华管理学院全国优秀大学生学术夏令营申请表》（系统生成）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2. 个人简历（中英文均可）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3. 个人陈述：从系统下载模板，中英文均可。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4. 在线提交专家推荐信3封：中英文均可，其中2封须由相关学科具有副教授(含)以上或相当职称的专家提供。</span></span></p><p><span><span>5. 本科成绩单及排名证明：前5学期的成绩单原件及排名证明，并加盖教务部门印章（请于系统下载模板，也可使用所在院系模板）。系统填报排名须与排名证明一致，不一致者视为报名无效。</span></span></p><p><span><span>6. </span><span><span>英语水平证明：国家英语四级/六级、TOEFL、GRE、GMAT、雅思等考试成绩单。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>7. 各类竞赛、个人特长、荣誉奖励等相关证书（如有）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>8. 体现自身创新能力的代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果等材料（如有）。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>特别提示</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1.申请人仅限申请一个专业（方向），申请提交后无法修改。</span></p><p><span>2.申请人须准确填写身份证号码及姓名，填写有误则报名无效。</span></p><p><span>3.在线申请及提交材料：申请人在线申请无需寄送纸质材料，获得入营资格后须提交纸质材料，纸质材料不予退回。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>入营安排根据申请、初审情况确定，入营名单及活动安排另行通知。</span></strong></p><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>师资介绍</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/cVnxoYN37ASIRXibL2YbUVbuhRbmcHY0fe1z2yjjwFUS6c8j6sFicYgw101ymRiazVpBhKSQnQdRFwibNStbQZxoTg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>谢宇</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>YU XIE</span></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>美国国家科学院院士、美国艺术与科学院院士</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>美国普林斯顿大学社会学和国际研究Bert G.Kerstetter '66讲席教授、当代中国研究中心主任</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>北京大学讲座教授、光华管理学院社会研究中心主任</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>微信公众号“知识分子”创刊主编之一、编委会成员</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>主要研究领域：社会分层、统计方法、人口学、科学社会学和中国研究</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><secti